# Foundry LevelDB pack runtime artifacts — ship the pack DATA (*.ldb), not the
# volatile per-session bookkeeping. LevelDB rotates these every time the world
# opens/writes/compacts (new *.log, renumbered MANIFEST-*, updated CURRENT), and
# they get OS-locked while Foundry runs — committing them churns the tree and
# breaks checkout/merge. The compendium content is re-seeded at runtime from the
# code seeds (quality-seeds.js), so these files are a disposable cache.
packs/**/LOCK
packs/**/LOG
packs/**/LOG.old
packs/**/*.log
packs/**/MANIFEST-*
packs/**/CURRENT


docs/
docs/foundation-roadmap.md
